OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of rape and several other
OL,8,Foffences in Shropshire.
OL,10,FWest Mercia Police said the boy, who is
OL,11,F14, was arrested at an address in
OL,12,FLawley, Telford on 2 September.
OL,14,FThe force has not released details of
OL,15,Fthe other alleged offences.
OL,17,FThe boy has been released on bail as
OL,18,Finquiries continue.
